### ===================================
### YouTube Channel API Tests
### Base Path: /api/ai/ytb/channel
### ===================================

### Get All Channels (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/channel?page=0&size=20

###

### Get Channel by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/channel/1

###

### Get Channel by Link
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/channel/link?channelLink=https://www.youtube.com/@ChannelName

###

### Get Enabled Channels
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/channel/enabled

###

### Get Videos for Channel
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/channel/1/videos?page=0&size=20

###

### Create New Channel (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/channel
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelName": "English Learning Channel",
  "channelLink": "https://www.youtube.com/@EnglishLearning",
  "description": "Great channel for learning English",
  "enabled": true
}

###

### Update Channel (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/channel/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelName": "Updated Channel Name",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

###

### Enable Channel (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/channel/1/enable
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Disable Channel (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/channel/1/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Delete Channel (Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ytb/channel/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
